WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.162
<v><b>L:</b></v> The Highland Hotel’s twenty miles from here.

2
00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:08.858
<v><b>M:</b></v> Fine. No problem. Let’s go there.

3
00:00:08.918 --> 00:00:12.973
<v><b>L:</b></v> Yes. Alfie’s asleep now.

4
00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:14.051
<v><b>M:</b></v> Great.

5
00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:18.929
<v><b>L:</b></v> Mel! Look! A police car!

6
00:00:19.363 --> 00:00:20.844
<v><b>M:</b></v> OK, OK.

7
00:00:26.919 --> 00:00:32.351
<v><b>P:</b></v> Good evening. Turn off the engine, please. Thank you.

8
00:00:32.979 --> 00:00:37.379
Can I see your driving licence? Thank you.

9
00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:40.042
<v><b>M:</b></v> What’s the problem, officer?

10
00:00:40.237 --> 00:00:42.930
<v><b>P:</b></v> One of your back lights isn’t on.

11
00:00:43.214 --> 00:00:46.686
<v><b>M:</b></v> Oh dear. I’m very sorry, officer.

12
00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:53.614
We’re on our way to the Highland Hotel. We’re very near now. And we’re with a baby.

13
00:00:53.824 --> 00:00:58.806
<v><b>P:</b></v> Ah, what a beautiful baby! What’s his name?

14
00:00:59.031 --> 00:00:59.944
<v><b>L:</b></v> Alfie.

15
00:01:00.946 --> 00:01:10.209
<v><b>P:</b></v> Oh dear, sorry! OK… go to your hotel. But please drive very slowly.

16
00:01:10.463 --> 00:01:14.413
And fix your light. There’s a garage near the hotel.

17
00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:17.182
<v><b>M:</b></v> Yes – thank you, officer.

18
00:01:17.346 --> 00:01:20.144
<v><b>P:</b></v> Goodbye. Goodbye, Alfie!

19
00:01:32.998 --> 00:01:35.183
<v><b>M:</b></v> Good boy, Alfie.